            "detailed_description": "FATE is the penultimate chapter in the six-part BIT.TRIP series and will leave you wondering what’s next.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The arrow keys control CommanderVideo while the mouse allows you to fire anywhere on screen! Or if you prefer, plug in a controller for dual-stick shooting action!<br></li><li>Collect power-ups to call on CommanderVideo’s friends for powerful shot upgrades!<br></li><li>A chiptune-inspired dubstep soundtrack helps bring the action to a whole new level!<br></li><li>Video game worlds collide with appearances from Super Meat Boy and Mr. Robotube!<br></li><li>Chipmusic artist Minusbaby helps set the tone with a special guest appearance!<br></li><li>Enjoy brand new Easy and Hard Difficulty Modes!</li></ul><br>Ride the vibe in BIT.TRIP FATE to discover where CommanderVideo’s true mission will take him.",
